{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"next","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"MaximalCliques.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques.swift#L284"},"externalID":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V8IteratorV4nextSay6VertexQzGSgyF","title":"next()","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"next","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"IteratorProtocol.next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator\/next()"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/iterator\/next()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator"]]},"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"type":"topic","title":"MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"abstract":[],"title":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/Iterator/next()":{"abstract":[],"title":"next()","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator\/next()","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/iterator\/next()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"next"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"title":"Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","role":"collection"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/Iterator":{"title":"MaximalCliques.Iterator","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Iterator"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Iterator"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/iterator","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator","role":"symbol"}}}